{"slug":"jim-oberstar","qid":"Q465775","name":"Jim Oberstar","desc":"United States Congressman (1934-2014)","article":"Jim Oberstar","born":"1934-09-10","died":"2014-05-03","birthplace":"Chisholm","parties":["Democratic Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"MN-08","f":1975,"u":2011}],"summary":"James Louis Oberstar (September 10, 1934 – May 3, 2014) was an American politician and congressman who served in the United States House of Representatives from 1975 to 2011. Hailing from Minnesota and a member of the state's local Democratic–Farmer–Labor Party, he represented the northeastern eighth congressional district, which included the cities of Duluth, Brainerd, Grand Rapids, International Falls, and Hibbing, within an area of Minnesota known as the Iron Range. He chaired the House Transportation and Infrastructure Committee from 2007 until his departure, having been the ranking minority member since 1995.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":2010,"o":"H","k":"MN-08","p":"D","v":129091,"s":46.59,"w":false,"n":"James L Oberstar"},{"y":2008,"o":"H","k":"MN-08","p":"D","v":241831,"s":67.69,"w":true,"n":"James L Oberstar"},{"y":2006,"o":"H","k":"MN-08","p":"D","v":180670,"s":63.61,"w":true,"n":"James L Oberstar"},{"y":2004,"o":"H","k":"MN-08","p":"D","v":228586,"s":65.22,"w":true,"n":"James L Oberstar"},{"y":2002,"o":"H","k":"MN-08","p":"D","v":194909,"s":68.65,"w":true,"n":"James L Oberstar"},{"y":2000,"o":"H","k":"MN-08","p":"D","v":210094,"s":67.85,"w":true,"n":"James L Oberstar"},{"y":1998,"o":"H","k":"MN-08","p":"D","v":173734,"s":65.99,"w":true,"n":"James L Oberstar"},{"y":1996,"o":"H","k":"MN-08","p":"D","v":185333,"s":67.31,"w":true,"n":"James L Oberstar"},{"y":1994,"o":"H","k":"MN-08","p":"D","v":153161,"s":65.66,"w":true,"n":"James L Oberstar"},{"y":1992,"o":"H","k":"MN-08","p":"D","v":167104,"s":59.04,"w":true,"n":"James L Oberstar"},{"y":1990,"o":"H","k":"MN-08","p":"D","v":151145,"s":72.91,"w":true,"n":"James L Oberstar"},{"y":1988,"o":"H","k":"MN-08","